WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.673
When a session grows,

2
00:00:01.673 --> 00:00:06.160
you can check what’s taking up space
before you decide whether to compact.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.815
Slash safe compact info shows how
much context the session is using,

4
00:00:11.815 --> 00:00:16.360
the thresholds for compaction, and
estimates for what’s in the prompt.

5
00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:27.233
Use the numbers to understand
the current session.

6
00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:30.433
The info command leaves
the conversation in place.
